* ''The controller seat stays Opus and swaps at every batch land'' (operator, 2026-11-07, same approval). The spend reads on session length before tier, so the seat passes to a fresh session by message at each batch boundary; a Claude lane lead runs Sonnet by default and Opus for a seam, custody or security lane, and every custody slice keeps its blind Opus read. One batch's controller spend, read from its transcript, tests the lean.

